<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

  <%- include('partials/head', {
    title: 'Digital Intelligence & Analytics Consulting | CPG Development',
    description: 'Turn digital data into better business decisions with analytics, conversion tracking, dashboards and performance measurement from CPG Development.',
    canonical: 'https://cpg.dev/services/digital-intelligence',

    schema: {
      '@context': 'https://schema.org',
      '@type': 'Service',
      '@id': 'https://cpg.dev/services/digital-intelligence#service',
      name: 'Digital Intelligence Consulting',
      url: 'https://cpg.dev/services/digital-intelligence',
      description: 'Digital intelligence consulting focused on analytics, conversion tracking, dashboards and digital performance measurement.',
      provider: {
        '@id': 'https://cpg.dev/#organization'
      }
    }
  }) %>

</head>

<body>

  <%- include('partials/header', {
    currentPath: '/services/digital-intelligence'
  }) %>


  <main id="main-content">


    <section class="service-hero">

      <div class="container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Digital Intelligence
        </p>

        <h1>
          Turn Digital Data Into Business Intelligence
        </h1>

        <p class="service-hero__lead">
          CPG Development helps organizations transform website,
          marketing and customer-behavior data into clear,
          actionable information that supports better decisions.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/digital-performance-audit"
          class="button button--primary"
        >
          Evaluate Your Digital Performance
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          What Is Digital Intelligence?
        </h2>

        <p>
          Digital intelligence is the process of collecting,
          connecting and interpreting digital performance data
          so an organization can understand what users are doing,
          what is driving results and where opportunities for
          improvement exist.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is not simply to produce more reports.
          It is to turn measurement into information people can
          actually use.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          Digital Intelligence Services
        </h2>

        <div class="service-detail-grid">

          <article>
            <h3>Analytics Strategy</h3>
            <p>
              Define the metrics, events and outcomes that actually
              matter to the organization.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Conversion Tracking</h3>
            <p>
              Measure the actions that connect digital activity
              to meaningful business outcomes.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Dashboards &amp; Reporting</h3>
            <p>
              Transform complex performance data into dashboards
              and reporting designed for decision-makers.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Performance Analysis</h3>
            <p>
              Identify trends, friction, opportunities and changes
              that deserve attention.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          From Reporting to Decisions
        </h2>

        <p>
          CPG focuses on the questions behind the numbers:
          What changed? Why did it change? What does it mean?
          And what should happen next?
        </p>

        <p>
          When measurement identifies a technical or experience
          problem, CPG can also help implement the improvement
          through our
          <a href="/services/optimization-development">
            optimization and development services
          </a>.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section final-cta">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          Find Out What Your Digital Data Is Telling You
        </h2>

        <p>
          Start with a Digital Performance Audit to identify
          measurement gaps, performance opportunities and the
          areas that deserve attention first.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/digital-performance-audit"
          class="button button--primary"
        >
          Get a Digital Performance Audit
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>


  </main>


  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>